  "title": "Air Fryer Chicken Nuggets",
  "description": "Air fryer chicken nuggets made with chicken pieces coated in seasoned panko crumbs until perfectly crispy and golden outside, tender and juicy inside.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
